@startuml Sequence Diagram - View Current Plan

actor "User" as User
participant "BillingView" as BillingView
participant "ClerkAuth" as ClerkAuth
participant "Backend" as Backend

User -> BillingView : 1 Open billing/plan page
activate BillingView
BillingView -> BillingView : 2 Display current plan info

BillingView -> ClerkAuth : 3 Request plan details
activate ClerkAuth
ClerkAuth -> Backend : 4 Fetch plan data
activate Backend
Backend -> Backend : 5 Retrieve plan record
Backend -> ClerkAuth : 6 Return plan data
ClerkAuth -> BillingView : 7 Return plan info
BillingView -> User : 8 Display current plan details

deactivate Backend
deactivate ClerkAuth
deactivate BillingView

@enduml
